# Contact app POC

Full text: `rule/` in the repo. Follow those files when you write code.

- This is a browser POC. App data lives in `localStorage` only through `src/lib/store.js`.
- Use JavaScript (`.js`), not TypeScript.
- Import with `@/`.
- Do not add a database, login server, SMS, or cloud upload.
- Do not add npm packages unless React, Next.js, or the browser API cannot do the job.
- Before new Next.js APIs, read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
- Keep one store. Pages read `useStore()` and write only through store functions.
- Geography is a tree plus a `geoPath` object. Use `GeoPicker` and `inArea` / `contactInArea`.
- Roles are only `staff` and `public`. New public routes must be added to `isPublicAllowed` in `AppShell.js`.
- UI: slate + teal-800, shared classes in `src/components/ui.js`. Phone first. Nav chips on a small screen. Dark sidebar from `md`. Sticky shell in `AppShell`.
- Docs in `features/` and `dataflow.md` use ASD-STE100. Keep the same words: contact, store, geoPath, area, staff, public, POC.
